{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TerrApocalipse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Defend planet Terra from threats, meet your unimaginably powerful enemy, build  spaceships sweeping away entire hostile armada with one salvo of their cannons, develop futuristic technologies, explore vast solar system and discover forgotten history.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop your profile in RPG style, you have several paths to choose from, it's up to you which one you follow or whether you create a unique solution that suits your playing style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Strength</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Win by choosing a path of strength and creating spaceships capable of single-handedly opposing countless enemy units. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wisdom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will allow you to develop futuristic technologies that will give you an advantage over your opponent and surprise his units.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Leadership</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create an armada that can defeat the most numerous opponents thanks to cooperation skills and good training.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/6068c374aae9db58b50e370b65cdc49a.avif?t=1760090623\" width=300 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build and produce</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Construct space stations orbiting planets and moons, produce spaceships, equipment and weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Research and gather resources</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Collect resources from asteroids and battles, invent new types of spaceships, weapons and upgrade them until they become even more deadly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each weapon has up to 9 upgradeable parameters, each parameter can be upgraded up to a maximum of 20 level.\u00a0Once you meet the requirements, you can unlock 3 stronger variants of a given weapon. This will let you to create equipment that will allow you to play the game in the way that is most enjoyable for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/069ff5588995a68b7a047c33d01256d9.avif?t=1760090623\" width=400 height=322 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each spaceship has 9 upgradeable stats, each stat can be upgraded by 20 levels. Once you meet the requirements, you can unlock new, more powerful spaceships\u00a0to play the way you like.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/extras/a2c76ec650b4be30c810189777535caa.avif?t=1760090623\" width=512 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight and conquer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expand your military capabilities across solar system to protect your most precious planet. Your goal is to get rid of enemy from the solar system.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007500?t=1760090623","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/2a16aa0c6c877a65e85888dee94d240f1d83f4c1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760090623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007500/a962f7ae3a17bc0ffa1f154421cd91a77179e70e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760090623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai